# STM32F103 boot/connect smoke test. The local stm32f103.repl plus
# the rcc_stub.py at 0x40021000 (RCC) is the F1-specific path - F0/G0
# /F4/F4xx/F429/H7 each take a different Renode platform with its
# own RCC model from upstream, so this test pins down the F1 path
# end-to-end. The multi_mcu_avr_stm32 / multi_mcu_stm32_stm32 tests
# already exercise stm32f103 in a multi-bridge context; this is the
# narrower single-MCU regression target.
DICTIONARY stm32f103.dict
CONFIG stm32f103_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR stm32f103_smoke.fixture.json

# A few harmless gcode lines so klippy gets past klippy:ready.
M114
M105
M105
M105

# klippy connected and stayed connected long enough to do the
# clocksync handshake against the TIM2-driven firmware clock.
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
